  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global e-Schools and Communities Initiative (GeSCI) is a organisation working with ICT for education (ICT4E). Sidas support is a            non-earmark support for GeSCI&#xb4;s strategy        2013-2016. GeSCI is a global organisation primarily working at a      global level. When working in countries it is among the least         developed countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global e-Schools and Communities Initiative (GeSCI) &#xe4;r en             organisation som arbetar med ICT f&#xf6;r utbildning (ICT4E). Sidas st&#xf6;d   &#xe4;r ett icke-&#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r             genomf&#xf6;rande av GeSCI&#xb4;s strategy 2013-2016. GeSCI &#xe4;r en global        organisation som fr&#xe4;mst arbetar p&#xe5; global niv&#xe5;. N&#xe4;r verksamheten r&#xf6;r  landsamarbeten avser det l&#xe4;nder som &#xe4;r bland v&#xe4;rldens fattigaste.</narrative>
  </description>
